cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit in published work, please cite it as below."
title: "geo-measure-toolkit"
abstract: >-
  Measurement and judgment tooling for Generative Engine Optimization (GEO)
  experiments: power/MDE inversion, six statistical lint rules, a tautology
  audit for treatment arms that mechanically rewrite their own outcome, prompt
  freezing for rebuilding paired arms, score-free candidate feature extraction,
  and an information-preservation gate for free-text rewrites. Pure standard
  library; no numpy, scipy or matplotlib.
authors:
